Odin 2: the hooks the WebCLAP port needs (ODIN_WEBCLAP, ODIN_HEADLESS).

- ODIN_HEADLESS: a DSP-only build without the editor (module.wasm), no message box in setStateInformation
- onReadPatch: the page tells the DSP side about patch loads; getValueTreeState for the non-parameter trees
- readPatch applies the patch's FX order (on desktop only the editor does, so a host restoring a project with
  the editor closed kept the previous order)
- the browser starts at 100 % zoom (the config file does not persist there)
- Aldrich sized like on Windows: the browser measures fonts by hhea like CoreText (see getAldrichFont)

